<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise 8.1 pct in week.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise 8.1 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose 8.1 percent in the week to January 8 over the equivalent week a year ago, figures from the Bank of England showed. Last week the rise was 4.1 percent.</p>
<p>(figures in rounded billions of stg) -</p>
<p>			   Latest week  Previous week  Year-ago week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation  21.38	  22.6		19.79</p>
<p> Bankers deposits	1.96	   2.44		1.73</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
